"},"say:5:1620621005:0":{"text":"아... 변신술의 선조의 눈이라. 어쩐지, 이래서 날 볼 수 있었던 거군. 앞길이 아주 밝겠어.","source_cn":"噢……变形术先祖感应能力，怪不得可以感应到我，看来是位...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8C6F322B7591CE13","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아... 변신술의 선조의 눈이라. 어쩐지, 이래서 날 볼 수 있었던 거군. 앞길이 아주 밝겠어.","female":"아... 변신술의 선조의 눈이라. 어쩐지, 이래서 날 볼 수 있었던 거군. 앞길이 아주 밝겠어.","variant_male_record_index":"213816","variant_female_record_index":"213817","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620621006:0":{"text":"내가... 뭘 해주면 되지?","source_cn":"有什么……我能为你们做的吗……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F9D30A142AE1669","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1620621006":{"text":"내가... 뭘 해주면 되지?","source_cn":"有什么……我能为你们做的吗……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F9D30A142AE1669","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1620621007:0":{"text":"오... 일부러 그런 건 아니었는데.","source_cn":"哦……那并不是我的本意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D30AB8CF6CE4F7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1620621009:0":{"text":"다... 당신... 유령이에요? 아니면 뭐예요?","source_cn":"你……你到底是幽灵，还是什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD79F0454BC894FF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_ti